==Description==

The [[Image:Assembly_LinkSelectLinked.svg|24px]] [[Assembly_LinkSelectLinked|Assembly LinkSelectLinked]] tool selects the linked assembly and switches to its original document.

==Usage==

# Make sure that an assembly is active.
# Select a linked assembly.
# Select the {{MenuCommand|Assembly → [[Image:Assembly_LinkSelectLinked.svg|16px]] Go to Linked Assembly}} option from the menu.
# The source document of the linked assembly is opened in a new tab of the [[3D_View|3D View]]. (please confirm)


